WEBVTT

00:00:05.432 --> 00:00:08.333
The Irresponsible Captain
Tylor

00:00:09.036 --> 00:00:11.905
We may be off the maps...
Chizu ni Nai Tabi Tsuzukeyou

00:00:11.905 --> 00:00:13.964
...but let's stay on this voyage.
Chizu ni Nai Tabi Tsuzukeyou

00:00:14.808 --> 00:00:18.938
I will be holding, never let you go.

00:00:20.514 --> 00:00:23.350
Whatever we may want...
Hoshimono wa Tsukamu no sa

00:00:23.350 --> 00:00:25.477
...we'll take as we need.
Hoshimono wa Tsukamu no sa

00:00:26.253 --> 00:00:30.280
So let's just go wherever we please!
Omoi no Mama Yukou!

00:00:31.992 --> 00:00:34.762
Make me your partner...
Kotoba yori Tashikana Koto

00:00:34.762 --> 00:00:37.390
...on this journey.
Kotoba yori Tashikana Koto

00:00:37.664 --> 00:00:41.259
One that you trust more than words!
Michizure ni Shite

00:00:42.703 --> 00:00:47.367
Come on now and sail away for future!
Imasugu sail away for future

00:00:48.375 --> 00:00:49.877
Things are waiting...
Mishiranu Nanika ga Matteru sa

00:00:49.877 --> 00:00:53.074
...that we've never seen before!
Mishiranu Nanika ga Matteru sa

00:00:54.915 --> 00:00:57.084
Just take your cares...
Kodawari Minna Sutetara

00:00:57.084 --> 00:01:01.145
...and throw them all away.
Kodawari Minna Sutetara

00:01:01.388 --> 00:01:06.018
Come together, just think of tomorrow.

00:01:07.795 --> 00:01:09.285
Let's go!

00:01:12.599 --> 00:01:15.932
IN DEMOTION DOES
A WOMAN BLOOM

00:01:28.248 --> 00:01:29.772
Master Sergeant Cryburn!

00:01:32.152 --> 00:01:35.918
Aren't you in charge of
shipboard cleaning today?

00:01:36.290 --> 00:01:38.053
I don't remember anyone
telling me about it.

00:01:38.392 --> 00:01:40.189
You... You don't remember?!

00:01:40.360 --> 00:01:42.328
Hey, Sarge. Didn't you say you...

00:01:42.396 --> 00:01:45.229
...switched off cleaning duty
with Lieutenant Andressen?

00:01:46.033 --> 00:01:47.000
Switched off?!

00:01:48.035 --> 00:01:49.366
Maybe I did.

00:01:50.337 --> 00:01:52.464
No one filed a report with me!

00:01:52.706 --> 00:01:57.666
And I thought Lieutenant
Andressen was on watch tonight...

00:01:58.345 --> 00:02:00.472
Then who's on watch?!

00:02:02.049 --> 00:02:04.882
Busy little gal, ain't she?

00:02:17.064 --> 00:02:19.589
I knew it! No one's here!

00:02:25.072 --> 00:02:26.937
Whoa, what's with you?

00:02:27.741 --> 00:02:30.301
I take it you switched off
with Lieutenant Andressen?

00:02:30.377 --> 00:02:33.005
No, I'm filling in for Kim.

00:02:33.080 --> 00:02:34.547
Lieutenant Kim?!

00:02:34.615 --> 00:02:37.049
She says night duty's
bad for her skin.

00:02:37.417 --> 00:02:39.214
Bad for her skin?!

00:02:40.087 --> 00:02:41.554
Something wrong?

00:02:49.663 --> 00:02:51.290
What do you think?

00:02:53.033 --> 00:02:54.125
Nighty-night.

00:02:56.403 --> 00:02:57.233
Captain!

00:02:57.771 --> 00:03:00.865
Even if nothing's supposed to happen
out here in the demotion sector...

00:03:01.441 --> 00:03:05.036
...you have a duty as captain to
enforce even the smallest rules!

00:03:05.145 --> 00:03:08.012
Mm, yes. She's right!
No matter how quiet it is...

00:03:08.081 --> 00:03:11.016
...a soldier's life must be
well disciplined at all times!

00:03:11.185 --> 00:03:14.086
If you agree, why haven't
you, the first officer...

00:03:14.154 --> 00:03:16.281
...acted on your
own to fix this mess?

00:03:17.357 --> 00:03:19.222
I'm terribly sorry...

00:03:19.459 --> 00:03:20.721
For heaven's sake!

00:03:23.964 --> 00:03:24.760
Well?!

00:03:25.098 --> 00:03:28.090
Yuriko, your skin's
looking a little dry.

00:03:28.468 --> 00:03:32.268
Someone as pretty as you
should take better care of it.

00:03:34.808 --> 00:03:36.241
Leave my appearance
out of this!

00:03:36.777 --> 00:03:38.574
Right, right.
I won't mention it.

00:03:38.645 --> 00:03:41.113
But even if I don't,
you're still pretty.

00:03:43.483 --> 00:03:45.178
Good morning!

00:03:57.998 --> 00:03:59.295
Lipstick, huh?

00:04:00.033 --> 00:04:03.230
Yeah, it looks good on you.
I really envy girls.

00:04:13.313 --> 00:04:17.272
Are you familiar with the rules
for being on duty, Lieutenant Kim?

00:04:18.185 --> 00:04:20.119
As long as they don't
interfere with my job...

00:04:20.187 --> 00:04:23.486
...I believe wearing makeup
and accessories is allowable.

00:04:23.857 --> 00:04:26.052
Under normal
circumstances, perhaps.

00:04:26.493 --> 00:04:29.894
But we're currently flying
in the demotion sector.

00:04:30.864 --> 00:04:31.922
Demotion...

00:04:32.833 --> 00:04:33.959
...is not normal!

00:04:34.501 --> 00:04:37.834
Could you stop going on about
the ship being downgraded?

00:04:38.705 --> 00:04:40.696
Things are depressing
enough around here.

00:04:41.208 --> 00:04:42.197
I'm sorry.

00:04:42.876 --> 00:04:45.845
I mean, I know how hard this is,
but if headquarters sees...

00:04:45.912 --> 00:04:49.143
...that we're following regs
better than we were before...

00:04:49.316 --> 00:04:51.250
...then they might
get us reassigned.

00:04:52.853 --> 00:04:53.649
She's right.

00:04:53.787 --> 00:04:55.846
Oh? But isn't it
the other way around?

00:04:56.857 --> 00:04:58.825
Being out in the
demotion sector...

00:04:58.892 --> 00:05:02.828
...and out of sight of
those HQ tight-asses...

00:05:02.896 --> 00:05:05.023
...means we can
act any way we want to!

00:05:05.899 --> 00:05:09.027
You should really loosen
up a little, Commander.

00:05:09.870 --> 00:05:10.928
Exactly.

00:05:11.505 --> 00:05:13.496
That'll keep
us out here forever!

00:05:13.640 --> 00:05:15.301
Am I wrong?

00:05:17.411 --> 00:05:18.343
Sounds fine to me!

00:05:19.646 --> 00:05:20.635
Captain!

00:05:21.248 --> 00:05:22.647
Guess I'm right.

00:05:34.428 --> 00:05:38.694
Um, surely we don't have
to do this, Commander Star!

00:05:38.765 --> 00:05:41.233
Why don't we try
what we did last time?

00:05:45.238 --> 00:05:48.469
We won't get them to obey
us by just tricking them!

00:05:48.542 --> 00:05:52.376
Unless we lead by example,
no one will follow us!

00:05:53.280 --> 00:05:54.304
Of course you're right.

00:05:54.614 --> 00:05:57.310
Allow me to agree
with you completely.

00:06:00.554 --> 00:06:02.112
Great job, guys!

00:06:02.956 --> 00:06:03.945
Lieutenant Kim!

00:06:05.926 --> 00:06:09.225
Doesn't seeing Commander Star
setting an example and...

00:06:09.296 --> 00:06:12.094
...cleaning the ship like
this mean anything to you?!

00:06:12.532 --> 00:06:15.000
Oh? Am I on cleaning duty?

00:06:15.302 --> 00:06:18.567
Neither the commander nor I
have cleaning duty. However...

00:06:18.772 --> 00:06:21.900
If you're telling me I have
to help you, that's fine.

00:06:21.975 --> 00:06:25.570
I just wish you'd told me sooner.
It's going to ruin my manicure.

00:06:26.313 --> 00:06:27.245
Why, you!

00:06:27.481 --> 00:06:29.540
Never mind, Lieutenant.

00:06:29.616 --> 00:06:32.244
I'd prefer she do a better
job while on duty.

00:06:32.319 --> 00:06:33.547
Aye, aye!

00:06:41.628 --> 00:06:43.323
Thanks for cleaning the ship!

00:06:44.998 --> 00:06:46.932
What are you doing
in those clothes?!

00:06:47.000 --> 00:06:50.265
Mr. Tylor thinks it's boring to
just wear uniforms all the time...

00:06:50.337 --> 00:06:53.465
...and said we can wear civvies
as long as we're not on alert.

00:06:55.008 --> 00:06:58.842
So we're just taking
advantage of his offer.

00:06:58.945 --> 00:06:59.639
See you!

00:07:02.616 --> 00:07:03.708
Did they...

00:07:04.918 --> 00:07:07.785
Did they just say it was
the captain's orders?

00:07:16.363 --> 00:07:18.558
Lieutenant Katori!
Where did the captain go?!

00:07:18.632 --> 00:07:21.328
Huh? Um... I dunno.

00:07:24.004 --> 00:07:24.868
Commander!

00:07:30.677 --> 00:07:33.077
And it's so nice and
quiet out there, too...

00:07:46.726 --> 00:07:47.385
Hi!

00:07:49.296 --> 00:07:52.163
I hear you're building
something cool, Charly.

00:08:07.013 --> 00:08:09.379
Damn it, watch
where you're going!

00:08:10.684 --> 00:08:13.380
For Pete's sake...
That was close!

00:08:14.087 --> 00:08:17.181
Promise you'll tell
me as soon as it's done!

00:08:23.597 --> 00:08:24.495
Captain!

00:08:24.731 --> 00:08:27.598
Did you authorize the crew
to wear civvies on duty?!

00:08:27.667 --> 00:08:29.897
Or is the crew just mistaken?

00:08:30.036 --> 00:08:32.527
Aw, come on,
it's not a big deal.

00:08:32.606 --> 00:08:34.699
Look, everyone's
so bored around here!

00:08:43.383 --> 00:08:44.975
Miss Kim, you look great!

00:08:45.452 --> 00:08:46.384
Thank you!

00:08:51.391 --> 00:08:51.948
Huh?

00:08:52.459 --> 00:08:56.395
Lieutenant Kim! Even if the
captain is allowing this...

00:08:56.463 --> 00:08:59.193
...do you think you can respond
to an emergency dressed like that?

00:09:02.135 --> 00:09:07.698
We'll be fine! We're not going
to have any emergencies out here!

00:09:07.807 --> 00:09:10.708
Commander, if you
don't loosen up...

00:09:10.777 --> 00:09:13.177
...all that stress is
going to ruin your skin.

00:09:13.480 --> 00:09:15.072
And you...

00:09:15.148 --> 00:09:17.514
And you consider yourself
a professional soldier?!

00:09:18.151 --> 00:09:21.780
Pardon me, but doesn't being
a soldier mean that...

00:09:21.888 --> 00:09:25.415
...I'm ready for an emergency
no matter how I'm dressed?!

00:09:25.825 --> 00:09:28.385
Stop judging people
by their appearances!

00:09:28.795 --> 00:09:30.387
You overblown hall monitor!

00:09:30.797 --> 00:09:31.786
What did you call me?!

00:09:32.165 --> 00:09:35.726
Captain, is there anything
wrong with how I'm dressed?

00:09:35.835 --> 00:09:37.860
No, you look great.

00:09:38.171 --> 00:09:40.105
How good she looks
isn't the point!

00:09:40.173 --> 00:09:43.108
Is this appropriate dress
for carrying out one's duties?!

00:09:43.176 --> 00:09:46.111
First of all, wearing civvies
on duty is against the regs!

00:09:46.179 --> 00:09:48.113
Well, if you say so...

00:09:48.181 --> 00:09:50.672
Captain, are you
canceling the order?!

00:09:50.884 --> 00:09:51.748
Captain!

00:09:53.753 --> 00:09:57.120
Ladies... Can't we
all just get along?

00:10:14.808 --> 00:10:18.141
So, just by putting
on that helmet...

00:10:18.211 --> 00:10:20.645
...I can play virtual
reality Whack-a-Mole?

00:10:21.147 --> 00:10:25.140
Despite appearances, I was really
into gadgets when I was a kid.

00:10:25.218 --> 00:10:27.709
And I've mastered practically
every game there is.

00:10:49.576 --> 00:10:51.066
Whoa! Hold it!

00:10:51.911 --> 00:10:55.176
I haven't programmed
a virtual hammer yet...

00:10:55.248 --> 00:10:56.681
...so it's a little dangerous.

00:11:07.894 --> 00:11:11.421
Um, Commander? May I help you?

00:11:11.865 --> 00:11:12.832
No, thank you.

00:11:13.266 --> 00:11:14.790
Confirming onboard
weapons stores...

00:11:14.868 --> 00:11:17.837
...and checking the ship's
safety systems is my job.

00:11:18.271 --> 00:11:20.762
You just do your job, Lieutenant.

00:11:20.840 --> 00:11:21.499
Right...

00:11:28.248 --> 00:11:30.273
Why don't you take a
walk around the ship?

00:11:30.617 --> 00:11:32.448
Right! Excuse me.

00:11:33.119 --> 00:11:36.282
Lieutenant Kim, aren't you
taking this a little too far?

00:11:37.791 --> 00:11:40.555
I said I'm not goofing off.

00:11:40.894 --> 00:11:43.590
I don't really think
that's the problem.

00:11:46.299 --> 00:11:49.632
My, isn't this sector quiet?

00:11:51.304 --> 00:11:54.273
If you say so, sir,
but I'm having a hard time...

00:11:54.340 --> 00:11:57.571
...keeping stray RF hash
out of our main systems.

00:11:57.811 --> 00:11:59.073
Oh. Sorry.

00:12:04.250 --> 00:12:08.653
It's embarrassing, your getting
caught up in a girls' quarrel.

00:12:08.922 --> 00:12:11.982
That's easy for
you to say, Doctor.

00:12:12.258 --> 00:12:15.625
But the military doesn't
teach us how to resolve them.

00:12:15.962 --> 00:12:17.657
What's the captain
doing about it?

00:12:17.931 --> 00:12:19.831
Nothing, as usual.

00:12:20.200 --> 00:12:22.896
That may be the
only thing to do.

00:12:23.103 --> 00:12:24.866
You must be... Ow!

00:12:24.938 --> 00:12:26.166
You must be joking!

00:12:26.339 --> 00:12:29.934
If this goes on, what will
happen if there's an emergency?

00:12:30.877 --> 00:12:34.608
They're both soldiers.
Don't forget that.

00:12:34.681 --> 00:12:35.670
But...

00:12:36.015 --> 00:12:40.315
Well, your worrying won't
change the situation.

00:12:43.189 --> 00:12:45.657
Lieutenant Kim, it's time
for your scheduled report.

00:12:45.992 --> 00:12:47.550
I made it a while ago.

00:12:47.927 --> 00:12:49.792
I wasn't told about
a schedule change.

00:12:49.929 --> 00:12:54.161
When not on alert, small schedule
changes don't have to be reported.

00:12:54.400 --> 00:12:55.628
Get her! Get her!

00:12:55.702 --> 00:12:59.339
It'd be fun if they actually
started throwing punches.

00:12:59.339 --> 00:13:00.931
Think they'd go that far?

00:13:01.107 --> 00:13:03.974
Their pride would
never let them do it.

00:13:04.110 --> 00:13:06.078
Aw, I want some action!

00:13:06.379 --> 00:13:07.346
Lieutenant Kim!

00:13:08.381 --> 00:13:12.545
There's a strange circuit open
on board. What's going on?!

00:13:12.986 --> 00:13:14.613
Uh-oh! They've spotted it!

00:13:20.226 --> 00:13:22.319
Can we help you, Lieutenant?

00:13:30.370 --> 00:13:34.101
Tapping the bridge is considered
a treasonable offense.

00:13:34.974 --> 00:13:37.442
No one ever told me that!

00:13:37.744 --> 00:13:41.475
If you don't want to be court-
martialed, then cut the crap!

00:13:41.748 --> 00:13:45.184
When did you suddenly
get all high and mighty?

00:13:45.418 --> 00:13:48.683
You wearing that getup
to turn the captain on?

00:13:52.592 --> 00:13:55.060
I've NEVER used my being
a woman to get ahead!

00:13:57.030 --> 00:13:58.361
That little bastard...

00:13:58.531 --> 00:14:00.726
Definitely not a
"bastard," Lieutenant.

00:14:01.000 --> 00:14:02.900
Do you wanna die?!

00:14:06.372 --> 00:14:08.806
So, who's got watch tonight?

00:14:09.108 --> 00:14:10.632
I'm on tonight.

00:14:11.044 --> 00:14:14.207
And no matter what happens,
I'll be ready for it.

00:14:15.114 --> 00:14:18.015
Lieutenant, I'll switch
off with you tonight.

00:14:18.284 --> 00:14:21.014
I still have some onboard
safety checks to run.

00:14:21.421 --> 00:14:23.946
But Commander Star,
you were on last night.

00:14:24.424 --> 00:14:27.416
When I joined the Force,
I came prepared to...

00:14:27.493 --> 00:14:30.485
...do the same work
as any man. Don't worry.

00:14:31.764 --> 00:14:33.732
Working at night
is bad for your skin.

00:14:34.067 --> 00:14:36.729
If I were just concerned
with personal appearance...

00:14:36.803 --> 00:14:38.270
...I wouldn't have
joined the military!

00:14:39.138 --> 00:14:41.299
You're a strong-
hearted girl, Yuriko.

00:14:42.075 --> 00:14:43.633
Well, do a good job tonight!

00:14:45.311 --> 00:14:48.872
I'm going to sleep, too, so I
can be prepared for an emergency.

00:14:49.816 --> 00:14:50.874
Good night!

00:14:51.784 --> 00:14:52.751
See you later.

00:14:54.487 --> 00:14:55.249
Um...

00:14:55.822 --> 00:14:56.811
Please go.

00:15:03.463 --> 00:15:04.725
I'm hungry.

00:15:22.515 --> 00:15:24.540
So, what do I wear tomorrow?

00:15:25.518 --> 00:15:27.782
If I were just concerned
with personal appearance...

00:15:27.854 --> 00:15:29.321
...I wouldn't have
joined the military!

00:15:42.535 --> 00:15:43.661
Well, of course!

00:15:56.482 --> 00:15:59.315
Red high heels...

00:16:10.029 --> 00:16:10.893
A fire!

00:16:27.447 --> 00:16:28.243
It's locked!

00:16:32.185 --> 00:16:32.810
Commander!

00:16:33.586 --> 00:16:36.111
It won't open!
And the fire's in here!

00:16:37.557 --> 00:16:39.457
Charly might be in there!

00:16:39.592 --> 00:16:41.617
Lieutenant! What's going on?!

00:16:43.162 --> 00:16:46.188
What's going on?
Wait, who's inside then?

00:16:48.201 --> 00:16:50.226
The captain!
The captain's in there!

00:16:52.572 --> 00:16:53.470
Captain!

00:16:53.940 --> 00:16:55.407
We'll have to break it down.

00:16:56.275 --> 00:16:57.264
The Hammers!

00:16:58.244 --> 00:16:59.142
Wait!

00:17:11.624 --> 00:17:12.352
Captain!

00:17:13.226 --> 00:17:15.126
Charly, do you have an
extinguisher system in here?!

00:17:22.735 --> 00:17:23.224
Kim?!

00:17:23.469 --> 00:17:25.903
I've used them before
for fires in the comm room!

00:17:26.105 --> 00:17:28.198
This is the best
way to fight them!

00:17:28.441 --> 00:17:29.840
Come on! Follow me!

00:17:32.945 --> 00:17:34.003
What are you waiting for?!

00:17:40.653 --> 00:17:42.712
Hurry up and bring
more extinguishers!

00:18:17.023 --> 00:18:18.581
What's up, guys?

00:18:18.991 --> 00:18:20.288
CAPTAIN!

00:18:34.340 --> 00:18:35.272
Commander...

00:18:35.708 --> 00:18:38.268
The captain's burns
aren't very serious.

00:18:38.544 --> 00:18:42.708
God, I guess you can't predict
when an emergency might happen.

00:18:43.282 --> 00:18:46.649
Well, I've been in the Force
a little longer than you...

00:18:46.719 --> 00:18:50.985
...so I expect disaster to
strike when I least expect it.

00:18:52.358 --> 00:18:54.292
I'm sorry for the
way I've been acting.

00:18:57.363 --> 00:18:58.091
Drink?

00:18:59.065 --> 00:19:00.327
If it's dry.

00:19:00.733 --> 00:19:01.859
Picky, aren't we?

00:19:04.370 --> 00:19:06.338
Doctor, let me have some!

00:19:06.739 --> 00:19:10.402
Idiot! There's no
alcohol for the wounded!

00:19:10.610 --> 00:19:13.841
Anyway, it looks like
you were right, Doctor.

00:19:14.080 --> 00:19:17.243
Good grief...
Women's relationships...

00:19:17.316 --> 00:19:20.308
Well, thanks to the
captain's little accident...

00:19:20.386 --> 00:19:23.048
...we're getting some fair
weather after the storm.

00:19:24.757 --> 00:19:26.349
Captain?

00:19:26.425 --> 00:19:28.825
Christ, can't
he ever keep still?

00:19:36.035 --> 00:19:38.526
I thought being
assigned to this ship...

00:19:38.604 --> 00:19:40.834
...would be a quick
ticket to battle.

00:19:41.474 --> 00:19:45.706
I wouldn't figure you to
volunteer for front-line duty.

00:19:46.379 --> 00:19:49.041
Well, I thought that having
to fight for my life...

00:19:49.115 --> 00:19:51.049
...would help to bring
it more into focus.

00:19:51.117 --> 00:19:53.415
War's a matter
of life and death.

00:19:54.120 --> 00:19:55.087
Commander?

00:19:55.655 --> 00:19:56.383
What?

00:19:56.556 --> 00:19:58.820
Why did you join up?

00:19:59.125 --> 00:20:02.561
Can't you tell? I think
if I weren't in the Force...

00:20:02.628 --> 00:20:06.064
...with a lot of clear-cut
rules for everything...

00:20:06.132 --> 00:20:08.930
...I'd just end up
drifting in my life.

00:20:10.303 --> 00:20:12.396
Strange to think how
weak I really am.

00:20:12.705 --> 00:20:17.005
Really? You, Commander?!
I'd never guess it!

00:20:19.145 --> 00:20:21.079
Having fun? Here.

00:20:21.447 --> 00:20:23.745
You're being unusually
considerate, Captain.

00:20:24.016 --> 00:20:24.880
Thanks.

00:20:26.319 --> 00:20:28.753
Well, Commander,
no matter where we go...

00:20:28.821 --> 00:20:31.255
...we find people who
never understand anything.

00:20:31.357 --> 00:20:31.982
Perhaps.

00:20:32.758 --> 00:20:35.022
I feel sorry for you.

00:20:35.161 --> 00:20:39.598
The person who just doesn't
get anything is your captain.

00:20:39.932 --> 00:20:41.058
Would you get a clue?!

00:20:42.835 --> 00:20:46.236
I think I'm starting
to understand you.

00:20:46.839 --> 00:20:49.034
I just wish she'd
start to understand me.

00:20:49.442 --> 00:20:51.342
I think of who I am...

00:20:52.345 --> 00:20:55.508
...and think that I may
be the one who's drifting.

00:20:57.183 --> 00:21:00.118
Those red high heels
looked good on you.

00:21:00.319 --> 00:21:02.514
But it just didn't feel
right wearing them anymore.

00:21:04.123 --> 00:21:05.852
You wanted someone to
see them, didn't you?

00:21:07.193 --> 00:21:08.956
Oh, it doesn't matter now.

00:21:09.428 --> 00:21:12.158
Now that you've complimented
them, I'll throw them away!

00:21:13.499 --> 00:21:14.989
Well, then, can you
give them to me?

00:21:15.201 --> 00:21:18.295
Oh? You wear high heels?

00:21:18.871 --> 00:21:20.634
Hey, I AM a woman, you know.

00:21:20.973 --> 00:21:22.702
And who will you wear them for?

00:21:22.875 --> 00:21:27.039
I don't know. But I'll wear
those red high heels someday!

00:21:27.213 --> 00:21:30.011
Exactly! We're women,
but still soldiers!

00:21:30.216 --> 00:21:31.774
And soldiers, but still women!

00:21:32.351 --> 00:21:33.375
And we decide
which comes first?

00:21:33.886 --> 00:21:35.353
Case by case.

00:21:35.821 --> 00:21:39.154
Brilliant as always!
Here's to you, Commander!

00:21:39.358 --> 00:21:41.485
And here's to red high heels!

00:21:44.897 --> 00:21:46.558
Um, can I have some?

00:21:50.903 --> 00:21:52.837
And silence returns.

00:21:53.239 --> 00:21:55.332
In demotion sector S-4...

00:21:55.508 --> 00:21:58.170
...like a gentle breeze,
silence returns to...

00:21:58.244 --> 00:22:01.338
...the United Planets Space
Force destroyer Soyokaze.

00:22:12.525 --> 00:22:13.492
The Irresponsible Captain Tylor
Next Episode

00:22:15.127 --> 00:22:17.330
If you meet a lovely girl by a
lake on the night of a full moon...

00:22:17.330 --> 00:22:19.298
...it's probably a dolphin
playing a trick on you.

00:22:19.365 --> 00:22:22.926
But if you meet another captain
at midnight, it just might be!

00:22:23.336 --> 00:22:25.270
Next time, "The Day
the Soyokaze Vanished."

